  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6205.02 Mobile Prop Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6205.02 Mobile Prop Fees.\n\n(a) New Hampshire fire department and fire-related state agencies shall be charged fees for the utilization of mobile props, as follows:\n\n(1) There shall be no charge for the first 2 utilizations of mobile props in a fiscal year; and\n\n(2) Each subsequent utilization of mobile props in a fiscal year shall be the actual expenses incurred by the division, as calculated per Saf-C 6202.\n\n(b) Individuals and entities that are not New Hampshire fire departments and fire-related state agencies shall be charged the actual expenses incurred by the division for utilization of mobile props.\n\nSource. #12477, eff 2-8-18 (formerly Saf-C 6204.02)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c6200.html"
}
